  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sound wave passes from cold air to warm air as shown on the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is true about the wavelength and the frequency of the wave as it crosses the cold air-warm air boundary?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Both the wavelength and the frequency decrease.</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">Both the wavelength and the frequency increase.</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">The wavelength increases and the frequency is unchanged.</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">The wavelength decreases and the frequency is unchanged.</li>\n</ol>"
  },
